── Step 4 of 10 · Why it can't just be edited ──────────────────────────────────
  This card payment is reconciled: it was matched to the real bank statement.
  Xero refuses to let software edit a reconciled transaction, so the check
  stopped this entry until a way round was chosen.
  Why this matters: The statement match is what proves a payment happened; it
  isn't undone to fix a code.
